Fix security vulnerabilities, runtime bugs, and code quality issues

- Fix 6 pages calling non-existent apiClient methods (get/post/put/delete)
- Add auth guard and tenant isolation to RuntimeController.simulate
- Add tenant isolation to KnowledgeService.retrieve
- Fix PacksService.install passing wrong args to botsService.update/saveDraftFlow
- Fix PacksService.installNewVersion stringifying object instead of name
- Add SSRF protection in ToolExecutorService (block private IPs, localhost)
- Add .catch() to bootstrap() for unhandled rejection
- Fix audit log cross-tenant data leak when user is undefined
- Fix webhook signature verification bypass for non-web channels
- Fix XSS via innerHTML in widget (use textContent instead)
- Fix widget session key collision (namespace by botId)
- Fix token refresh race condition with mutex pattern
- Fix React memory leak in FlowBuilder (cleanup on unmount)
- Batch simulator setState calls to avoid unnecessary re-renders
- Fix auth guard flash-of-content and use router.replace
- Fix API URL fallbacks missing /api prefix across all configs
- Replace console.error with NestJS Logger across backend services
- Fix health controller throwing raw Error instead of HttpException
- Fix rate limit guard referencing unimported Observable type
- Add password min-length validation to login schema
